"""Part 8e-i mutations: the camera module's core, the frame keeper, the human effects' ctor / dtor.

Run with the camera build: --build build_camera.bat --check check_camera.py (CAMERA_TEST).

Equivalent (left alive, by design):
  C 38 num / arith     |square - 1| < 1e-8 holds only for a square of exactly 1 (the floats by 1
                       are 6e-8 apart); the normalization by 1 / sqrt(1) leaves it as it is.
  C 46 cmp, C 48 cmp   the component is not 0 there; >= and > agree.
  C 50 del / cmp / num the y axis (x and z 0): the car's direction has its y replaced by -0.3
                       before it is used; the view's flat direction is only used when the view's
                       y is 0.3 (x and z then not both 0).
  C 81..89, 380, 381, 479..482 del   static_asserts.
  C 242 num            the version not read: only 2 differs from 0.
  C 253 del, 255 del   the chunk closed by its destructor; nothing read after.
  C 444 cmp            a float is never the double 0.03.
  CH 71..78, CH 247..249 num   the tactical states and camera modes, not used by the camera
                       build (the command interface's, the effects' and the first-person view's
                       builds use them).
"""
